The costs for this service are 1% per annum. Based on current values &amp; expected contributions, minus the initial fee, this would be equal to circa £1,101.85 for the first year. This will vary in line with your fund value. This fee will be paid via the Aviva Platform pension scheme as you prefer to pay via your provider rather than directly.

## Wills

